OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of murder had 'beef'
OL,4,Awith teen before fatal stabbing, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man accused of murdering a teenager
OL,8,Fhad been involved in a disagreement
OL,9,Fwith him in the weeks before he was
OL,10,Fstabbed to death, a court has heard.
OL,12,FTristan Kerr, 17, from Abertridwr, in
OL,13,FCaerphilly, bled to death in the street
OL,14,Fminutes after being stabbed in the
OL,15,Fheart and lung with a so-called Zombie
OL,16,Fknife on 5 February.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
